[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_03_0010","text":"——咦\n这台相机，不是事务所的啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_03_0020","text":"是雾子的……还是——？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_03_0030","text":"不……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_03_0040","text":"不是，吗\n那是不是谁落下的呀——？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_03_0050","text":"说不定……\n是结华酱的……也说不定……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_03_0060","text":"噢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_03_0070","text":"挂绳……\n很像结华酱的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_03_0080","text":"啊，确实\n很花哨的感觉嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_03_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_03_0090","text":"——不好意思——！\n三峰的相机在吗！？我落下了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_03_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_03_0100","text":"呵呵呵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700200_03_0004","text":"Motion"}]
